## Endpoints

### Auth Flow (4)
- `GET /publicKey/init` — Initialize public key for authentication.
- `GET /sso/rac` — Perform SSO authentication.
- `GET /ssoDomain/getList` — Get a list of SSO domains.
- `GET /uc/graphic/sessionId/refresh` — Refresh graphic session ID.

### Data Read (8)
- `GET /{id}` — Get data for a specific ID.
- `GET /area/get` — Get area information.
- `GET /event/getRule` — Get rules for events.
- `GET /follow/product/batchIsFollow` — Check if products are followed in batch.
- `GET /new/{newId}` — Get details for a specific news item.
- `GET /uc/countryItems` — Get a list of countries.
- `GET /usual/address` — Get user's usual addresses.
- `GET /v3/exception` — Get exception details.

### Data Write (3)
- `POST /{id}` — Post data to a specific ID.
- `POST /v4/exception` — Report an exception.
- `POST /v4/speed/{speedId}` — Post speed data for a specific ID.

### Media (2)
- `GET /fido-source/ubc/1.0.0/wasm_crypto_bg.wasm` — Get WebAssembly crypto module.
- `GET /tencent/video_v3` — Get Tencent video information.

### Config (2)
- `GET /miniprogram-platform/configure-lowcode-platform-node/prod/json/prod/xvCLOWHl.json` — Get lowcode platform configuration.
- `POST /h5/init` — Initialize H5 environment.

